# Commit messages

Follow [Conventional Commits 1.0.0](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/).

- One subject line, 72 characters or fewer.
- Format: `type(scope): description`
- Type is `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, or `chore`.
- Scope is optional. Description is imperative and lowercase.
- No body, footer, or file list. Use `type!:` only for a breaking change.

# Good

feat: show Habits+ in the browser tab

# Bad

Update the metadata title and description in the English and Ukrainian locale files, and also change the README heading so the app is called Habits+.
